      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_11",
      "quote": "Despite global efforts to identify effective interventions for the prevention and treatment of covid-19, which have resulted in approximately 3000 trials completed or underway, evidence for effective treatment remains limited.",
